# Release Notes

## EN
We have introduced several key updates to make your app experience more secure, convenient, and efficient for your daily needs. This update focuses on adding new tools and improving the overall speed and reliability of the application.

- You can now use your fingerprint or face to sign in quickly and securely with biometric login
- Access all your alerts in one place with the new in-app notification center
- Switch to dark mode in your settings for a more comfortable viewing experience at night
- Easily plan and manage your future transactions with the new scheduled payment feature
- Improved app startup speed so you can get things done much faster than before